<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage dips to 5.788 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage dips to 5.788 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage eased to 5.788 billion rand on Monday from 6.622 billion rand on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
